{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00253",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 5.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thank you for staying late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.49,
      "end_seconds": 10.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Okay, yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.87,
      "end_seconds": 14.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Well, I've been having pain in the lower right tummy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.43,
      "end_seconds": 18.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.62,
      "end_seconds": 31.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.76,
      "text": "It's been like this since this morning. My sister suggested writing things down, uh, but I forgot. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.2,
      "end_seconds": 42.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.83,
      "end_seconds": 54.08,
      "duration_seconds": 10.25,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, moving and coughing. That makes it worse. Severe, I'd say. Vomiting once was there, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.59,
      "end_seconds": 60.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any constipation, jaundice, burning when passing urine or hernia bulge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.15,
      "end_seconds": 67.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "I haven't had constipation, jaundice, burning when passing urine or hernia bulge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.44,
      "end_seconds": 70.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Let me just write this down properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.7,
      "end_seconds": 88.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Right, carry on. What medicines are you taking at the moment? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.75,
      "end_seconds": 96.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Well, you know, I'm on paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.15,
      "end_seconds": 100.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.52,
      "end_seconds": 101.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.71,
      "end_seconds": 120.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.87,
      "end_seconds": 127.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Okay, so my sister has thyroid problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.14,
      "end_seconds": 133.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.91,
      "end_seconds": 145.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.11,
      "text": "Oh, yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.34,
      "end_seconds": 150.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.0,
      "end_seconds": 153.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Yeah, not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.48,
      "end_seconds": 158.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.26,
      "end_seconds": 162.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Hmm, no problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.09,
      "end_seconds": 164.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.21,
      "end_seconds": 168.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I had a hysterectomy about twelve years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.47,
      "end_seconds": 182.97,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.88,
      "end_seconds": 189.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Oh, um, okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.64,
      "end_seconds": 193.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.86,
      "end_seconds": 207.97,
      "duration_seconds": 13.11,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, diabetes. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.51,
      "end_seconds": 209.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.47,
      "end_seconds": 215.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Okay, um, so I've had arthritis in my knees, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.37,
      "end_seconds": 238.63,
      "duration_seconds": 22.26,
      "text": "I see. Yes, I can see the arthritis in my knees in your file as well. What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.04,
      "end_seconds": 242.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.1,
      "end_seconds": 245.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.35,
      "end_seconds": 253.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.15,
      "end_seconds": 282.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.41,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, height 151 centimetres, weight 61 kilos. And BMI works out to 26.8, temp 39.0 degrees, pulse 90, respiratory rate 16, blood pressure 121 over 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.19,
      "end_seconds": 284.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.8,
      "end_seconds": 291.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.76,
      "end_seconds": 294.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.0,
      "end_seconds": 300.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.06,
      "end_seconds": 304.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.6,
      "end_seconds": 320.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "There's tenderness in the right lower part and it hurts when I let go suddenly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.25,
      "end_seconds": 323.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Yes, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.25,
      "end_seconds": 340.15,
      "duration_seconds": 14.9,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with possible appendicitis at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.96,
      "end_seconds": 344.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Oh, should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.05,
      "end_seconds": 366.84,
      "duration_seconds": 21.79,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible appendicitis, and we'll know more once the an ultrasound of the abdomen is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in the lower right tummy, since this morning, severe, and no hernia bulge or burning when passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.97,
      "end_seconds": 370.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.73,
      "end_seconds": 390.58,
      "duration_seconds": 18.85,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an ultrasound of the abdomen for right lower abdominal pain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'm going to order a urine test, for abdominal pain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.75,
      "end_seconds": 394.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.78,
      "end_seconds": 420.33,
      "duration_seconds": 25.55,
      "text": "Please don't eat or drink anything until the surgeons have seen you. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Keep an eye out, and if the pain gets sharper or spreads across the tummy, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.67,
      "end_seconds": 424.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let's review you today after the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.22,
      "end_seconds": 429.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Uh, you know, okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 429.67,
      "end_seconds": 434.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 435.66,
      "end_seconds": 441.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "So, you know, I come back today after the results. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 442.04,
      "end_seconds": 447.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Right, yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 447.94,
      "end_seconds": 452.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "That's all, uh, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.8,
      "end_seconds": 453.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}